# Ship every change

Every change in this repo goes live unless the user explicitly says not to publish (e.g. "don't deploy", "keep it local", "just a branch").

When you finish a change:

1. Verify it: `npm run build` must succeed, and for game changes load the game (`npx vite` in the game folder) and check it renders.
2. Commit to `main` with a clear message.
3. `git push origin main`. The `.githooks/pre-push` hook builds the site and deploys it to the Cloudflare Pages project `keikigames` (https://keikigames.com) using `.env`. If `git config core.hooksPath` isn't `.githooks`, run `npm run prepare` first.
4. Confirm the push output ends with a successful wrangler deploy, then check the changed page on https://keikigames.com.

If the user says not to publish: commit on a separate branch (or leave uncommitted if asked), or push with `SKIP_DEPLOY=1 git push`.
